  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\"><br></p><p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">자유낙하 운동 비교 가상실험(자유낙하 물체와 수평으로 던져진 물체의 운동 비교)<br></p><p><span style=\"display: inline !important; float: none; background-color: rgb(150, 150, 150); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">\r\n</span></p><p style=\"clear: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); float: none; font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: center; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\"><span class=\"imageblock\" style=\"border-bottom-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-image-outset: 0; border-image-repeat: stretch; border-image-slice: 100%; border-image-source: none; border-image-width: 1; border-left-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); border-left-style: solid; border-left-width: 1px; border-right-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); border-right-style: solid; border-right-width: 1px; border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); border-top-style: solid; border-top-width: 1px; display: inline-block; height: auto; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 5px; max-width: 100%; padding-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 5px; padding-right: 5px; padding-top: 5px; width: 630px;\"><img width=\"630\" height=\"378\" style=\"border-bottom-color: currentColor; border-bottom-style: none; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-image-outset: 0; border-image-repeat: stretch; border-image-slice: 100%; border-image-source: none; border-image-width: 1; border-left-color: currentColor; border-left-style: none; border-left-width: 0px; border-right-color: currentColor; border-right-style: none; border-right-width: 0px; border-top-color: currentColor; border-top-style: none; border-top-width: 0px; cursor: pointer; height: auto; max-width: 100%;\" src=\"https://img1.daumcdn.net/thumb/R1280x0/?scode=mtistory2&amp;fname=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile25.uf.tistory.com%2Fimage%2F99AF463C5D10078726E5E0\" filename=\"사용자 지정 1.png\" filemime=\"image/jpeg\"></span></p><p><span style=\"display: inline !important; float: none; background-color: rgb(150, 150, 150); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">\r\n</span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">공통과학에서 다루고 있는 내용입니다.<br>자유낙하 시킨 물체와 수평방향으로 던져진 물체의 운동을 비교하는 프로그램을 만들었습니다.<br>X축 방향으로 수평으로 던져진 물체의 운동은 중력에 의해 아래로 떨어지는 Y축 방향의 운동에 영향을 미치지 않는다는 것을 알 수 있습니다.&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"display: inline !important; float: none; background-color: rgb(150, 150, 150); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">\r\n</span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">지구상에서 같은 높이에서 수평방향으로 야구공을 아무리 세게 던지거나, 총을 쏜다고 해도, 공기에의한 효과를 무시한다면 바닥에 떨어지는 시간은 제자리에서 공을 자유낙하 시켰을때의 시간과 같습니다.</p><p><span style=\"display: inline !important; float: none; background-color: rgb(150, 150, 150); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">\r\n</span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">제가 잘하는 질문 총알은 얼마동안 날아갈까? 알고 싶으면 지우개를 총의 높이에서 들고 바닥으로 떨어뜨려 보면 된다. 지우개가 자유낙하 하는 시간이 총에서 발사된 총알이 날아가다가 바닥에 떨어지는 시간이다. (단 공기에 의한 효과나 총알의 회전 효과는 무시한다)</p><p><span style=\"display: inline !important; float: none; background-color: rgb(150, 150, 150); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">\r\n</span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">&lt;프로그램 사용법&gt;</p><p><span style=\"display: inline !important; float: none; background-color: rgb(150, 150, 150); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">\r\n</span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">시간간격을 조절할 수 있습니다. 시간간격 만큼 지날때 마다 공의 위치가 화면에 나타납니다. </p><p><span style=\"display: inline !important; float: none; background-color: rgb(150, 150, 150); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">\r\n</span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">X,Y축의 속력을 조절할 수 있습니다.<br>중력작용의 체크를 끄면 무중력 상태에서의 운동을 확인할 수 있습니다.</p><p><span style=\"display: inline !important; float: none; background-color: rgb(150, 150, 150); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">\r\n</span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">모눈종이를 눌러 보이게 할 수도 있고 사라지게 할 수도 있습니다.<br>운동한 물체는 시간간격에 의해 흔적을 남기게 만들어서 여러 운동을 시키고 비교할 수 있습니다.&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"display: inline !important; float: none; background-color: rgb(150, 150, 150); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">\r\n</span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">축구공도 드래그 해서 원하는 위치로 이동시킬 수 있습니다.</p><p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\"><br></p><p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">첨부화일은 아래 링크에서 다운받을 수 있습니다.</p><p><span style=\"display: inline !important; float: none; background-color: rgb(150, 150, 150); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">출처: </span><a style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\" href=\"https://sciencelove.com/2373\">https://sciencelove.com/2373</a><span style=\"display: inline !important; float: none; background-color: rgb(150, 150, 150); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\"> [김정식 허명성의 과학사랑]</span><b></b><i></i><u></u><sub></sub><sup></sup><strike></strike><br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
